        "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
        "source_quote": "6. PX-EXC-01 - Excluded active condition\nThe patient must have no confirmed active SYN-EXCLUDED-CONDITION at screening. A verified active\ncondition fails this criterion. Passing requires a reviewed record-completeness declaration supporting\nabsence at screening. No chart entry by itself is not evidence of absence; insufficient or contradictory\nevidence yields UNKNOWN. Preserve active, resolved and suspected clinical states separately from\nevidence verification.\n",
