        "source_quote": "3. PX-INC-01 - Age at screening\nThe patient must be 40 to 70 years old, inclusive, on 2026-10-31. Calculate age from a sourced birth date\nusing the site-local screening date. If birth-date precision cannot establish the age conclusively, return\nUNKNOWN. A confirmed age outside this inclusive range fails this criterion.\n",
