        },
        "evidence_requirement": "Latest specimen eGFR lab value within 30 days of screening.",
        "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
        "source_quote": "5. PX-INC-03 - Latest timely eGFR\nThe latest relevant eGFR must be at least 60 mL/min/1.73m\u00b2. Its specimen local calendar date must be in\n[2026-10-01, 2026-10-31], including both endpoints. Use specimen date, not issued, recorded or ingestion\ntime. Missing or stale evidence yields UNKNOWN; unsupported units yield UNKNOWN unless a reviewed\nconversion exists. A valid timely value below 60 fails. This threshold is fictional and is not a clinical\nrecommendation.\n",
        "source_id": "SRC-PDF-284bb70e055c4e8caa576d345b7dc2f1",
