        },
        "evidence_requirement": "New confirmed administration or reported use of SYN-CLASS-R during participation.",
        "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
        "source_quote": "8. PX-MON-01 - Confirmed restricted use\nDuring human-recorded participation, a new confirmed administration or documented use of\nSYN-CLASS-R requires investigator review. Reliable dated administration or reported-use evidence\ntriggers a CONFIRMED_PROTOCOL_CONFLICT finding linked to a review case. Evaluate\nclinical-effective time; preserve the earlier screening assessment. This is a rule conflict, not a determination\nof harm. It authorizes no automatic treatment change or withdrawal.\n",
        "source_id": "SRC-PDF-284bb70e055c4e8caa576d345b7dc2f1",
