        },
        "evidence_requirement": "New order or dispense of SYN-CLASS-R without confirmed use during participation.",
        "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
        "source_quote": "9. PX-MON-02 - Order or dispense without use\nDuring human-recorded participation, a new order or dispense of SYN-CLASS-R without confirmed use\nrequires medication reconciliation. Open a POTENTIAL_SAFETY_REVIEW case; actual exposure remains\nunknown. Retrieve administration and reported-use evidence where available. An order or dispense is not\nproof of ingestion and must not be reported as a confirmed-use conflict. A clinician supplies or reviews any\nreconciliation evidence.\n",
        "source_id": "SRC-PDF-284bb70e055c4e8caa576d345b7dc2f1",
