        "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
        "source_quote": "10. PX-MON-03 - New low eGFR\nDuring human-recorded participation, a new synthetic eGFR result below 60 mL/min/1.73m\u00b2 requires clinical\nreview. Use the clinical specimen/effective time, valid units and provenance. The result opens a\nrule-specific monitoring finding for human assessment; it is not a diagnosis, toxicity determination or\nautonomous withdrawal instruction. This rule adds no scheduled testing requirement or new screening\ncriterion.\n",
